Steamworks SDK redistributable
------------------------------

The Windows build ships steam_api64.dll and the Linux build ships
libsteam_api.so. Both files are Valve Corporation's Steamworks redistributable
libraries and remain under Valve's own terms.

They are loaded by the `steamworks` and `steamworks-sys` crates, which are
dual-licensed MIT / Apache-2.0 for the Rust code; that licence does not cover
the Valve libraries themselves.


